*** 1. Binlog index is a derived object that is never read back.

*** 1a. Replacing binlog index content with garbage.

*** Executing the Binlog Server utility and expecting it to regenerate
*** binlog index.
include/assert_grep.inc [Binlog index does not contain garbage]
include/assert_grep.inc [Binlog index lists all three binlog files]
