include/assert_grep.inc [Recreated binlog index lists all three binlog files]

*** 2. Binlog data files left after an interrupted binlog file creation
***    are removed.

*** Simulating two interrupted binlog file creations: one killed after
*** writing the magic payload and one killed right after creating an
*** empty file.

*** Executing the Binlog Server utility and expecting it to remove both
*** binlog data files.
include/assert_grep.inc [Binlog storage initialization found the first uncommitted binlog data file]
include/assert_grep.inc [Binlog storage initialization found the second uncommitted binlog data file]
include/assert_grep.inc [Binlog storage initialization removed uncommitted binlog data files]

*** 3. A binlog data file with events but without metadata is an error.

*** Executing the Binlog Server utility and expecting it to fail.
include/assert_grep.inc [Binlog storage initialization detected a binlog data file without metadata]

*** 4. An object with an unexpected name is an error.

*** Executing the Binlog Server utility and expecting it to fail.
include/assert_grep.inc [Binlog storage initialization detected an object with an unexpected name]

*** 5. Binlog metadata without its binlog data file is an error.

*** Executing the Binlog Server utility and expecting it to fail.
include/assert_grep.inc [Binlog storage initialization detected binlog metadata without binlog data file]

*** 6. A missing binlog metadata in the middle of the sequence is an
***    error.

*** Executing the Binlog Server utility and expecting it to fail.
include/assert_grep.inc [Binlog storage initialization detected a gap in binlog metadata ordinals]

*** 7. Binlog files left below the purge horizon after an interrupted
***    purge are removed.

*** Simulating a purge of the first binlog file that was committed (the
*** purge horizon was moved) but was killed before removing any objects.

*** Executing the Binlog Server utility and expecting it to finish the
*** purge.
include/assert_grep.inc [Binlog storage initialization found the binlog file below the purge horizon]
include/assert_grep.inc [Binlog storage initialization removed the binlog file below the purge horizon]

*** Checking that binlog index no longer lists the first binlog file.
include/assert_grep.inc [Binlog index lists the two remaining binlog files]
include/assert_grep.inc [Binlog index does not list the first binlog file]

